This patch documents the Phase 2 TrackEval extension. The CLEAR/Identity
metrics were computed by calling the official TrackEval metric classes
(trackeval.metrics.CLEAR, trackeval.metrics.Identity) over the same
preprocessed TAO_OW sequence data (src/iclr27_phase2/trackeval_clear_identity.py).
The only third-party source edit was the argparse scalarization in
scripts/run_tao_ow.py (see patches/TrackEval_iclr27_phase1.patch for the diff).
